+    standard daily-rebalance implementation). With ``hold=H>1`` the signal is
+    recomputed only every ``H`` bars (at ``i`` where ``(i - lookback) % H ==
+    0``) and carried forward unchanged between rebalances, so each position is
+    held for ``H`` bars. This is the holding-period robustness knob: it varies
